            "heading_size": "h1",
            "description": "<p>Nadco’s Lab Surface Contamination Wipes (also known as ‘LAB Wipes’, ‘Wipe Spot Pads’ ‘Surface Contamination Test Kit’ or ‘Wipe Test Kits’) are pressure sensitive planchettes that measure 1.75” in diameter and are suitable for conducting wipe tests in compliance with NRC and Agreement State Regulations.<br/><br/>NADCO is a leading provider of tape and label products, providing customized solutions for a wide range of industries and applications. Whether engineers require assistance determining the best materials for their projects or need help solving complex adhesive challenges, the experts at NADCO can deliver a tailored solution to meet their needs.<br/><br/>With years of industry experience and extensive manufacturing capabilities, we can work with our clients from start to finish to create quality tape and label products that meet your requirements for adhesion performance, safety, advertisement, and more. At NADCO, “If you can imagine it, we will make it stick!”<br/><br/>This long-lasting material performs optimally in several application environments and won’t deteriorate over time, ensuring a longer shelf life. Vinyl tapes and labels instantly stick on contact and can even outlast paint.</p>",
